WEBVTT

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.080
Good morning, Lili.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.130
Top of the morning, Master Bell!

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.920
Our first expedition turned out
to be kind of a nightmare, huh?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.580
You can say that again. I'm sure everyone's exhausted.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.710
Let's take it easy for a bit.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.960
Now that we've reached the safe zone,
we can go back to the surface anytime.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.880
Master Bell!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.080
Can you spare some time for me later?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.540
I'd like a chance to talk with you one-on-one.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.250
You don't mind waiting?

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:48.460
Not at all! Let's do it after you take care of business today
and don't have to worry about anything else.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.790
Sure. Sounds good.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.380
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.420
<b>Rabbit's Foot</b>

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.420
<b>Rabbit's Foot</b>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.250
It's about time that we had another Denatus!

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.710
I can hardly remember when the last one was.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:36.130
Come on, don't you remember
when Ikelos caused all that fuss?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.130
Oh yeah.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.460
That's why it got postponed, yeah?

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:43.040
The Denatus is a traditional meeting for us gods.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.290
But small talk and gossip are really
the only things that happen here.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.420
You said it. The gods are just here to kill time, honestly.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:55.210
Yeah, but there's something important going on in
this one that I absolutely had to show up for.

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.920
I heard all about it, Hestia.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.210
Hephaistos!

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:01.290
Your children had a rough time of it
down on the lower floors, huh?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.540
And now they're back on the 18th floor?

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:05.750
Yep!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.130
I got word of it, too.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.040
Everybody came back in one piece!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.420
Great. I'm sure it was a productive experience for them.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.040
I'm looking forward to
the thrilling stories we'll get to hear.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.830
Which is all the more reason that
we have to have this meeting today!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.290
Ah yes, the naming ceremony for adventurers.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:27.750
Yep. I gotta push hard so that Bell and Welf
can somehow walk away with decent aliases.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.170
Same for Chigusa and my other children.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.420
I have to see to it that they don't end up
with an alias like Mikoto's "Absolute Shadow".

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.670
I AM... GANESHA!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.710
And I have been assigned
the role of mediator for this Denatus!

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.790
Right! Let's get started!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.790
Okaaaaay...

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:50.540
All right. The alias for Welf Crozzo
from the Hestia Familia...

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.130
It's written as "Furei" but will be read as "Ignis"!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.380
We've settled on the name "Ignis"
using the kanji for "never" and "cold"!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>IGNIS</b>

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>(NEVER COLD)</b>

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:05.790
Okay, last up! Without further ado, it's time for us
to discuss the new alias for the ever-popular Bell Cranel!

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.380
Now we're talking!

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.380
Yahoo!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.790
But we just gave him an alias not too long ago!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.710
He's already ranked up twice since then!

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.080
That's insanely fast! I don't believe it!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.960
Pardon. May I offer a suggestion?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.830
Huh?!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.710
Whoa! From Lady Freya?!

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.670
Did the Little Rookie catch her eye or what?

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.630
Seriously? Are you part of Bell's fan club now?!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.500
Indeed.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.040
After I saw him battle against
that monster the other day...

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:31.460
I must admit he really got my heart pounding.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:36.250
Well, Freya! That's nice,
but this is MY Bell we're talking about,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.750
so you better have racked your brains
to come up with a darn good name for him!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.380
Of course. Have no worries, Hestia.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.130
I suggest we call him...

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.130
Vanadis Odr! It's such a fitting name!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:55.210
<b>VANADIS ODR</b>

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:55.210
<b>(HUSBAND OF FREYA)</b>

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.420
No freakin' way!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.420
You don't get to call him "husband"!
Bell is MY Familia, missy!

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.170
Aw, you didn't like my idea?

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.420
Because there's nothing to like about it!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.540
As tasteless as ever! That's what happens
when you've got nothing but sex on the brain.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.170
I've got my own idea for his name!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.630
Loizarus!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.750
<b>LOIZARUS</b>

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.750
<b>(TRICKER'S TOY)</b>

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.630
Where do you get off calling Bell YOUR toy?!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.080
You guys better start taking this seriously or el-!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.580
Up here! I've got a real gem!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.210
Chestnut Cream!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.670
<b>CHESTNUT CREAM</b>

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.670
<b>(MARRON RABBIT)</b>

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:24.960
It's so hard to write!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.460
That doesn't even make sense.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:30.000
Marry me Bell! Cuz I hear... Wedding Bells!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.880
<b>WEDDING BELLS</b>

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.880
<b>(MARRIED RABBIT)</b>

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.290
Hot damn, that's a good one!

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.670
Uh oh, I think Lady Freya's getting ticked off.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.040
What do you think of this?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:38.790
Mimirin!

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.580
<b>MIMIRIN</b>

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.580
<b>(RABBIT CUTIE)</b>

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.500
Now you're just being ridiculous!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.630
Anybody else have an idea?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:50.000
Leave it to me! You remember the rumors from a while
ago about that kid having the hots for monsters, right?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.380
Oh yeah, I did hear about that.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.080
So if you think about it...

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:59.290
Bell is a strapping young lad who can get turned on
by humans, monsters, and maybe even us gods!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.670
We dub him: Okay With All!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.500
<b>OKAY WITH ALL</b>

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.500
<b>(OMNISEXUAL)</b>

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:13.330
Quit it, you jerks! Stop acting like my Bell
is just some plaything for your amusement!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.580
Calm down, Hestia!

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.880
I'll calm down after they shut up!

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.920
E-everyone made fun of us...

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:26.580
You okay, Hestia?

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:31.330
It's no surprise since your Familia has been rising up
in the world. This is just part of the rite of passage.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.540
Come on, all's well that ends well.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.630
You fought hard and managed to make
sure his new name is rather innocuous.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.670
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.080
"Rabbit's Foot"...

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.920
<b>RABBIT'S FOOT</b>

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.920
<b>(WHITE RABBIT'S FOOT)</b>

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.880
That's going to be your new second name, Bell!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.500
How are you all doing?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:56.880
Sorry to worry you. The healer says that everyone
is making good progress on their way to recovery.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.710
Same here, we're all doing good with no problems!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.830
We really owe you big time.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.420
Well, I feel like I should apologize...
we couldn't fully heal you.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.420
It's okay. I actually consider myself lucky.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:12.170
Because I'm still alive after all that.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.460
So don't let it bother you.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.170
We only have ourselves to blame
for getting into that mess in the first place.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.210
It's simply the nature of going
on adventures in the dungeon.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.580
There's always a price that we must pay
when seeking the unknown.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.080
And that's a reality we have to accept.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.330
After we return to the surface,
we'll pay a visit to the Dian Cecht Familia

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:37.130
and have them outfit us with some good prosthetic limbs.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:43.250
I can already imagine our patron god whining up a storm
when he finds out that we'll also be living in debt.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.250
You have my thanks, Bell Cranel.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.960
On the honor of the name Luvis Lilix,

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.540
I swear to return the favor to you someday.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.710
You are a true ally to us Elves. Thank you.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.580
Mr. Luvis...

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.790
Hah! So much pomp and circumstance with you Elves!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.170
Thanks a million, you guys!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:06.960
If you ever find yourselves in trouble,
then we'll come help you out!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.580
We appreciate that, Mr. Dormul.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.630
Oh, one more thing!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.130
For the little Prum lady here...

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:14.460
Huh?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:20.830
I gotta say, the little speech you gave to everyone after
we thought all hope was lost... it really hit home.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.710
That lit a fire in us.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.040
O-oh, really?

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.170
Yes, I also wanted to mention that.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:33.170
Without your encouragement, I don't think we would
have held on long enough for Bell Cranel to arrive.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.000
Yeah! You make a hell of a strategist!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.540
W-well, it was no big deal...

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:55.170
So, hey, Master Bell? Are you finished
with your business for the day?

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.830
If you've got time, then maybe
we can have that chat I mentioned...

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.880
Oh, not yet. Sorry, Lili.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.420
I need to go see Mr. Ouka and Ms. Chigusa
because they also wanted to speak with me.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.830
Can you wait until I'm done with that?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.080
Of course!

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.040
I really screwed things up.

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:18.000
I let Chigusa get hurt and failed
my responsibility as a member of the vanguard.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:19.750
Please allow me to apologize.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.670
Ouka! It's not fair for you to take all the blame!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.500
I was the one who dragged the party down in the end.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.580
But that's...

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.710
Please stop, you two.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.630
You were already doing us a huge favor
by agreeing to come on the expedition.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:35.540
Is that all they wanted to talk about?

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:39.250
I guess Master Ouka and Lady Chigusa
are the earnest type, too.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:41.250
Even so, I keep thinking about it...

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.630
If I had just kept her safe during that attack,

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.580
then we wouldn't have been in such dire straits.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.540
Ouka...

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:51.460
We're all allies, no matter what Familia we're in.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.830
We cooperate to cover for whatever is missing.

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.750
And we prop each other up when mistakes are made.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.830
That's how a party works.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.290
It's why we survived that adventure.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.460
I think that's all that matters.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.000
Master Bell has really come into his own.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.040
I'm gonna make sure he listens
to everything that I have to say later!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.210
Look! There they are!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.420
Ms. Daphne and Ms. Cassandra?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.380
We're having some trouble! Help us out!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.880
You don't mind if we take away him, right?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.170
Pretty please!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.040
W-well, I think we've said
everything that needs to be said...

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.420
Great! Let's go!

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.130
Th-they hauled him away...

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.880
Ryu still hasn't come back, huh?

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.540
This is the third day since she went meowt.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.080
She's always disappeared suddenly from time to time.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.500
But she's never left a note behind before...

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:53.790
She's really been on pins and needles lately,
and I think she was remembering stuff about her past.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.880
Anyway, I have a sinking feline!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.080
I don't think anything bad has happened yet,
but maybe we're about to have some purroblems!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:01.880
Hey!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.540
Quit slacking, you bunch of dumdums!

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.670
Hurry and get ready for the evening rush!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.000
Hey, Mama Mia? Do you know what's going on?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.880
If she didn't tell you anything,
then she sure as hell didn't tell me.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.420
Good grief. That troublesome elf...

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:34.630
Oh, come on! Bringing Bell Cranel with you ain't fair!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.040
It's totally fair, because we're in the same party!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:38.790
Right?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:42.130
That's right... I had them join me
on an expedition down here.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:48.330
All right, then. Can't deny I owe you a favor from back
when that Black Goliath went on a rampage.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.080
I'll give you a discount,
but remember it's a one time deal!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.130
Hooray!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.920
You're a lifesaver!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.920
We needed to stock up on items for the trip back,
but he was charging us an arm and a leg!

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.460
Is that so?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.540
They're using Master Bell like a darn coupon...

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:07.540
And what's worse, we'll never have a chance
to benefit from it ourselves if it's a one time deal!

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:11.830
I know you're level 4 and all, so this
may seem like I'm just stating the obvious...

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.880
but I was honestly surprised by how tough you are!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.500
Like after you came back and
defeated that monster all by yourself!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:24.250
You made beating the crap out of it look so easy,
it's like we had nothing to worry about!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.040
It was amazing!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.000
U-um, I also wanted to thank you personally...

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.790
You know, for proving my clairvoyance wrong.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.130
Clairvoyance?

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.380
Sorry.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.080
You'll have to forgive her for all the crazy talk.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.710
Just know that we really are grateful to you.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:45.330
Here ya go. Just pay the regular price.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.420
Oh, I wanted to ask, Ms. Daphne.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.920
How did Lili fair as a strategist on the battlefield?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.630
From what I saw,

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.460
she has a talent for it.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.830
She showed good judgement and made quick decisions.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.830
And most importantly,
she was clearly striving to fill the role.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.130
Aw shucks!

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:08.040
All I did was frantically try to keep everybody alive...

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.250
Oh look, it's Master Bell.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:15.130
Lady Haruhime and I were just about
to have some tea. Would you care to join us?

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:19.250
Nah, we're good. Thanks for your help, Bell Cranel.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.380
Go have some fun.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.080
We'll hand him over to you now.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:31.080
"Hand him over" my butt! I'm the one who keeps
giving up time with Master Bell for all this crap!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:35.290
You should've seen Lady Haruhime's
new magic, it was incredible!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.170
Resound, golden melody. Call forth Tamamo.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.880
The white-faced, yellow-haired king of nine tails!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.420
Oh mythical beast, may your tails
consume all and grant every wish!

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.830
Dance and whirl!

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.670
Lady Haruhime looked truly majestic as she
was casting Level Boost on all of our allies!

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:56.580
I really wish you could've seen it yourself, Master Bell!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.290
L-Lady Mikoto, I don't deserve so much praise...

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.710
Come on, you gotta make sure he knows this stuff.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.750
Because that's the key to getting Master Bell to fall in
love with you.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:06.880
Fall in love?!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.710
Oh my!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.380
So my getting separated from the party...

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.540
put a lot of stress on you, huh?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:13.630
What?

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:16.580
Goddess told me about it before we left.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:22.580
Kokonoe is a spell that uses a lot of magic power.
And she said that using it would take a toll on you.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.920
I appreciate your concern, Master Bell.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.880
But I'm totally okay.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:30.000
Just look at how much energy I have now!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.380
Oh hey, Master Bell!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:35.920
If you don't mind, I'd love to hear the details of what
happened after you got separated from the rest of us.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.080
I would also like to hear the story!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.710
Oh no! That's exactly what
I was planning to ask him later!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:48.420
And after that, I had to fight against
a really fast monster called the Iguazu.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.420
Then I met Marie...

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:55.830
Uh, no! I mean, I rushed all the way back
so I could rejoin you guys.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:15:00.420
So you survived dropping all the way
down the Great Falls. That's amazing!

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:02.580
The speed of that Iguazu monster...

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.040
Was it faster than those seeds
the Moss Huge shot at you?

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.500
Yep. The Iguazu was even faster.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.250
It's like you're a hero from fairy tales, Master Bell!

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:21.630
This sucks! I was going to ask Master Bell about that
first! And then I could have been the one praising him!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.130
That was fun. We'll see you later.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.330
Goodbye for now.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.830
Whew. Looks like it's finally my turn.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.710
But I have to be careful,
those guys still haven't shown up...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:35.290
Yo, Bell! You're just in time, buddy!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.420
Aw crap, here they come!

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:36.920
Welf?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.630
And Ms. Aisha, too?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:43.170
These dudes won't stop asking me to tell 'em about
the crazy stuff that happened on the lower floors.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.580
Come join us for story time!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.040
Huh? Right now?!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.880
What kind of question is that?
The night's just getting started.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.130
C'mon, we're gonna live it up!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.920
Uh, hold on! I actually have plans that I need to...

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.920
It's okay, they can wait!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.380
Quit yer whinin' and get movin'!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.080
Jeez. The nerve of some people...

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:08.920
Step on up, folks! I've got the latest news straight
from the surface and this scoop is sure to shock ya!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:12.250
How about it? Have I piqued your interest, miss?

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.420
It won't be cheap, but I can tell you the new name
that the gods gave the famous Bell Cranel!

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.330
Master Bell?

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.630
Hoo boy, you really are something else!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.790
Not only did you run across a crazy
strong monster on your first expedition,

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.170
but your entire party made it back safely!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.540
Yeah, it was a group effort.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.750
C'mon, kid! You don't gotta be so modest!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:38.830
What a bunch of uncultured swine.
I don't know how people put up with adventurers.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.420
But whatever.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:43.000
Once they're done, nobody will be left to bother us.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:48.670
I can have a nice chat with Master Bell
and share the news about his alias!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:53.080
A'ight! I think it's about time
I shared a juicy piece of news with y'all!

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.790
"Juicy news"?

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.290
This info just came in from the surface earlier today!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:02.210
The gods have decided on
a new second name for the Little Rookie!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.130
No! I'm supposed to be the one who tells him!

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:10.330
From this point on the Little Rookie
will be known as... Rabbit's Foot!

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:14.420
Raise your mugs, boys! This calls for a celebratory drink!

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:15.880
Woo!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:20.170
"Rabbit's Foot"... my new second name.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:23.750
Curses! Why did those adventurers have to ruin it?!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.830
I was the one who should have broken that news to him!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.000
And I paid a bunch of money to learn about it!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:36.710
Damn it. I've had it with all of these stupid meddlers...

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.750
Ahh, that's it!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.130
I'm feeling so hot and bothered right now I can't stand it!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.750
C'mere, Rabbit's Food!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.170
Gah, Ms. Aisha! It's Rabbit's Foot!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.880
Oh whatever, Rabbit's Hood.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.960
You're gonna return all the favors
I've done for you tonight.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.130
Like I keep telling you, it's Rabbit's Foot!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:57.290
Rabbit's Hook? Rabbit's Wood?

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.750
Try not to wring him dry, Amazoness!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.210
Wh-what the hell?!

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:02.880
Run for it!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:10.290
Thanks for the save, Lili.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.420
Sorry to keep you waiting for so long.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.880
What is it that you wanted to talk about?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.170
Well, we don't need to bother anymore.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:26.750
You've already heard the things I wanted to ask and
talk about because everyone else beat me to the punch...

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:35.040
Like what happened to you after we got separated, and
about my job as strategist, and even your new alias...

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.080
But it all came as a relief to me.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.170
Because I could tell that
you're still the same old Master Bell.

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:42.630
What do you mean?

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:48.420
To be honest, I've had my concerns about you
ever since the incident with the Xenos happened.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:51.290
I'm not sure how to put this, but...

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:55.040
It seemed like you were running off
into a different world from the rest of us.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.960
I couldn't shake that feeling.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.790
But now I know it's wrong.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:06.420
While it's true that you've gotten way, way
stronger than you used to be in the past,

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.580
you're still the same Master Bell I know.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.920
A brave man with a kind heart who
never gives up in any circumstance!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.880
Lili!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:26.210
You're the same Master Bell who shouted
my name and saved me time and time again.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.750
You haven't changed since we first met.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.630
Lili...

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.290
I'm sorry.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.290
I didn't mean to worry you.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:44.000
Actually... maybe you have changed
in some ways, Master Bell.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.830
Like turning into more of a womanizer.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.380
Oh, by the way, Lili.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.330
I heard a lot about what happened from Mr. Luvis,
Ms. Daphne, and the others today.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:00.250
But what exactly did you say to instill hope
in everyone after I got separated from the party?

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.130
Huh?

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.460
I'm not leaving any of you here to die!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:06.040
I refuse to give up and run away!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:11.080
That's my job... because I'm his Supporter!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.460
I'm afraid that's secret, Master Bell!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.540
What? Come on, tell me.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.500
Nuh-uh! It's top secret!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:21.830
Master Bell!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.210
Congrats on your new name! Rabbit's Foot!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.420
I think it really suits you!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.380
Thank you, Lili.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.880
S-stop it!

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:45.000
Please spare me!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:49.000
I'm begging you! I don't know anything!

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:51.580
Don't do it!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.790
Please no!

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:03.540
We kept chatting for so long that the sun came up, huh?

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.750
Yep. But I had a good time.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:08.630
What's going on?

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.170
I'm not sure...

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.790
Hey! You're not bullshitting me, right?

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.880
You know that I would never lie about this!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.580
Mr. Bors!

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:20.790
Oh! Little Ro-... scratch that. I mean Rabbit's Foot!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.210
Did something happen?

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.040
There's been a murder.
A trader was killed on the outskirts of town.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.670
And you sure it wasn't a monster that did it?

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.080
Definitely not! I saw the culprit with my own eyes!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:34.830
It was the Gale Wind...

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:41.000
The black listed adventurer with a bounty on her head...
the Gale Wind murdered him!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.380
C'mon! There's no time to waste!

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:47.710
Hey Rabbit's Foot.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.290
You should come with us, too!

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:52.460
M-Master Bell!

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:55.380
Are they talking about who I think they are?

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:56.920
There's no way.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.040
It's just not possible.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.460
Ms. Ryu would never... murder someone!

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>Cassandra Ilion</b>

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>Dream Seer</b>

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:39.000
Next time: "Cassandra Ilion."
